{"candidateAnswer":"Elementary school, high school, and college and he was with his high school team for 3 years.","evidence":"[D6:13 | 1:08 pm on 11 August, 2023] John: Thanks! Basketball has been a part of my life ever since I was a kid. I'd watch NBA games with my dad and dream of playing on those big courts. When I turned ten, dad signed me up for a local league, and I've been playing ever since. I kept playing through middle and high school before earning a college scholarship. And after college, I was drafted by a team – my dream come true!\n[D9:4 | 6:59 pm on 26 August, 2023] John: We were teammates for four years in high school, so we've played together for quite some time. Have you ever been part of a sports team?","itemId":"urn:uuid:8f34720b-35d4-5e1f-bd77-18e881c81333","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:078791a21e01276f1b6beaef27c9b9e7ffa0809ee3a499b621766882952019b6","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What schools did John play basketball in and how many years was he with his team during high school?","referenceAnswer":"Middle school, high school, and college and he was with his high school team for 4 years.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"078791a21e01276f1b6beaef27c9b9e7ffa0809ee3a499b621766882952019b6"}}]}